4 Ingredient  Coconut Frozen Yogurt

This easy 4 ingredient coconut frozen yogurt is creamy, smooth, and perfectly balanced between sweet and tangy. No complicated methods. No weird additives. Just simple ingredients and solid technique for the Ninja Creami machine.

If you’ve ever wanted a quick homemade frozen dessert that actually tastes clean and fresh — this is it. Replace trhe coconut yogurt with anoy toher flavour and you've got a super simple but excellent frozen yogurt. 

Whether you’re looking for a lighter alternative to ice cream (just...) or just want something fast and delicious, this recipe delivers big texture with minimal effort.

⸻

🧊 Ingredients (4 Total)

• 296g Coconut Greek Yogurt (1.2 cups)
• 100g Allulose (0.5 cups) ( you can use normal sugar or xylitol but you'd need less of the xylitol)
• 37g Skim Milk Powder (0.32 cups)
• 327g Coconut Cream (1.3 cups)

That’s it.

